01:04:42.440 --> 01:04:44.440
Exactly

01:04:44.440 --> 01:04:46.440
Step efficiency calculates

01:04:46.440 --> 01:04:48.440
That my executor is not

01:04:48.440 --> 01:04:50.440
Going through the plan

01:04:50.440 --> 01:04:52.440
And is not doing the steps

01:04:52.440 --> 01:04:54.440
Which are taking more time

01:04:54.440 --> 01:04:56.440
Meaning that it is not doing any extra steps

01:04:56.440 --> 01:04:58.440
Which it should not do

01:04:58.440 --> 01:05:00.440
So the executor is not executing

01:05:00.440 --> 01:05:02.440
The steps by itself

01:05:02.440 --> 01:05:04.440
And because

01:05:04.440 --> 01:05:06.440
It does not have its own reasoning

01:05:06.440 --> 01:05:08.440
To execute some extra steps

01:05:08.440 --> 01:05:10.440
So we are not

01:05:10.440 --> 01:05:12.440
Measuring the step efficiency

